<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>NFT Market со скидками</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pacifico&family=Roboto:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
  </head>

  <body class="background">
    <header class="header">
      <div class="container header-container">
        <nav class="nav">
          <a href="#" class="nav-link">Коллекция</a>
          <a href="#" class="nav-link">Акции</a>
          <a href="#" class="nav-link">Вайт‑лист</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="#" class="logo">
          <span class="logo-icon">N</span>
          <span class="logo-text">NFTGO</span>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-actions">
          <a href="#create-nft" class="nav-link">Создать NFT</a>
          <a href="#" class="nav-link">Топы</a>
          <a href="#" class="nav-link">Контакты</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h1 class="title">NFT MARKET
          <span class="title-line2">со скидками</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="promo-section">
      <div class='sale-wrapper'>
        <span class="sale-text">Sale -50%</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grin-wrapper">
      <img class="cat" src="images/cat.png" alt="котик в скафандре">
    </div>

    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="#create-nft" class="button1"><span class="button1-text">Купить NFT</span></a>
      <a href="#gallery" class="button2"><span class="button2-text">Галерея</span></a>
      <span class="text">NFT, также уникальный токен — вид критографических токенов, каждый экземпляр <br>которых уникален и не сможет быть заменен или замещен другим аналогичным токеном,<br> хотя обычно токены взаимозаменяемы по своей природе.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="cards-row">
      <div class="card-container">
        <img class="pigimg" src="images/pig.png" alt="pig">
        <div class="wrapper"></div>
        <a href="#create-nft" class="round">+</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card-container">
        <img class="pigimg" src="images/monkey.png" alt="pig">
        <div class="wrapper"></div>
        <a href="#create-nft" class="round">+</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card-container">
        <img class="pigimg" src="images/hero.png" alt="pig">
        <div class="wrapper"></div>
        <a href="#create-nft" class="round">+</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <img class="spanch" src="images/spanchBob-no-bg-preview (carve.photos).png">

    <div class="background-round"></div>
    <img class="up" src="images/cityUp.png">
    <img class="down" src="images/cityDown.png">

    <div class="background-round1"></div>
    <div class="background-round2"></div>
    <div class="background-round3"></div>

    <div id="create-nft" class="create-wrapper">
      <h2 id="catalogTitle" class="carousel-title">Выберите персонажа</h2>

      <button id="prevBtn" class="round1">
        <div class="arrow">&lt;</div>
      </button>
      <button id="nextBtn" class="round0">
        <div class="arrow">&gt;</div>
      </button>

      <div class="background-wrapper1"></div>

      <div class="wrapper1">
        <div class="small-wrapper"><button class="select-character">Персонаж</button></div>
        <div class="small-wrapper"><button class="select-character">Фон</button></div>
        <div class="small-wrapper"><button class="select-character">Эффект</button></div>
        <div class="small-wrapper"><button class="select-character">Текст</button></div>
        <div class="small-wrapper"><button class="select-character">Цвет</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="wrapper-select"><button id="selectBtn" class="select">Выбрать</button></div>

      <div class="carousel-container">
        <div class="main-card">
          <img id="layer-img" src="" alt="активный элемент">
        </div>
        <div class="side-card" id="side-right"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="layer-group layer-bg-group hidden">
        <img id="layer-bg" src="" alt="фон NFT">
      </div>
      <div class="layer-group layer-char-group hidden">
        <img id="layer-char" src="" alt="персонаж NFT">
      </div>
      <div class="layer-group layer-effect-group hidden">
        <img id="layer-effect" src="" alt="эффект NFT">
      </div>
      <div class="layer-group layer-color-group hidden">
        <img id="layer-color" src="" alt="цвет">
      </div>
      <div class="layer-group layer-text-group hidden">
        <div id="layer-text" class="active-text"></div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div id="gallery" class="gallery">
      <h2 class="gallery-text">Галерея</h2>
    </div>
    
    <footer>
      <div class="footer-actions">
        <a href="#" class="footer-link">Создатель</a>
        <a href="#" class="footer-link">Дизайнер</a>
        <a href="#" class="footer-link">Програмист</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
